          "chunk_id": "s01_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c1_comparing_unpaired_samples_populatio",
          "text": "Comparing unpaired samples of a population measured at different points in time is a core challenge in biology, where measuring cells often destroys them.",
