        {
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "chunk_id": "s01_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c2_optimal_transport_recover_how_sample",
          "text": "Optimal transport can recover how samples map across distributions, but classical OT assumes mass is conserved, which breaks down when populations grow or shrink through cell proliferation and death.",
