          "anchor_id": "cue_s07_c1_across_real_single_cell_task_nubot",
          "text": "Across the real single-cell task, NubOT outperforms every baseline, including the current state-of-the-art unbalanced GAN, in almost all of the twenty-five drug perturbations, measured by a weighted version of kernel maximum mean discrepancy between predicted and observed perturbed cells.",
